-     "source_ref": "path/to/source:symbol",
-     "reason": "no target counterpart / only a stub / behavior differs",
-     "suggested_milestone": "Title + goal + the test selector(s) that would gate it"}
-  ],
-  "notes": "anything the next round should know"
-}
-```
